  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sopa de lima is built around "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "poaching"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "poaching"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " chicken directly in a spiced broth so the liquid absorbs the flavour of the bird as it cooks. Lime juice goes in at the end, off the heat, so it stays bright and sharp. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "garnishing"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "garnishing"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with fried tortilla strips is not optional. It adds the crunch that makes the soup complete."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: add the lime juice in two stages. Taste after the first addition and decide whether you want more bite."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
